{
  "data": {
    "id": "ROM.7.11-ROM.8.7",
    "orgId": "ROM.7.11-ROM.8.7",
    "bibleId": "7644de2e4c5188e5-01",
    "bookId": "ROM",
    "chapterIds": [
      "ROM.7",
      "ROM.8"
    ],
    "reference": "ΠΡΟΣ ΡΩΜΑΙΟΥΣ 7:11-8:7",
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "ἡ γὰρ ἁμαρτία ἀφορμὴν λαβοῦσα διὰ τῆς ἐντολῆς ἐξηπάτησέ με, καὶ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "δι᾽ αὐτῆς ἀπέκτεινεν. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ὥστε ὁ μὲν νόμος ἅγιος, καὶ ἡ ἐντολὴ ἁγία καὶ δικαία καὶ ἀγαθή.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.12"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Τὸ οὖν ἀγαθὸν ἐμοὶ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "γέγονε θάνατος; Μὴ γένοιτο. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἀλλὰ ἡ ἁμαρτία, ἵνα φανῇ ἁμαρτία, διὰ τοῦ ἀγαθοῦ μοι κατεργαζομένη θάνατον—ἵνα γένηται καθ᾽ ὑπερβολὴν ἁμαρτωλὸς ἡ ἁμαρτία διὰ τῆς ἐντολῆς. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Οἴδαμεν γὰρ ὅτι ὁ νόμος πνευματικός ἐστιν· ἐγὼ δὲ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.14"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "σαρκικός εἰμι, πεπραμένος ὑπὸ τὴν ἁμαρτίαν. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.14"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ὃ γὰρ κατεργάζομαι, οὐ γινώσκω· οὐ γὰρ ὃ θέλω, τοῦτο πράσσω· ἀλλ᾽ ὃ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "μισῶ, τοῦτο ποιῶ. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Εἰ δὲ ὃ οὐ θέλω, τοῦτο ποιῶ, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.16",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.16"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "σύμφημι τῷ νόμῳ ὅτι καλός. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.16",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.16"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Νυνὶ δὲ οὐκέτι ἐγὼ κατεργάζομαι αὐτό, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.17",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.17"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.17",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.17"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "οἰκοῦσα ἐν ἐμοὶ ἁμαρτία. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.17",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.17"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Οἶδα γὰρ ὅτι οὐκ οἰκεῖ ἐν ἐμοί, τοῦτ᾽ ἔστιν ἐν τῇ σαρκί μου, ἀγαθόν· τὸ γὰρ θέλειν παράκειταί μοι, τὸ δὲ κατεργάζεσθαι τὸ καλὸν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.18",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.18"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "οὐχ εὑρίσκω. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.18",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.18"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Οὐ γὰρ ὃ θέλω, ποιῶ ἀγαθόν· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.19",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.19"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἀλλ᾽ ὃ οὐ θέλω κακόν, τοῦτο πράσσω. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.19",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.19"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Εἰ δὲ ὃ οὐ θέλω ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.20",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.20"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἐγώ, τοῦτο ποιῶ, οὐκέτι ἐγὼ κατεργάζομαι αὐτό, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.20",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.20"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἀλλ᾽ ἡ οἰκοῦσα ἐν ἐμοὶ ἁμαρτία.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.20",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.20"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Εὑρίσκω ἄρα τὸν νόμον τῷ θέλοντι ἐμοὶ ποιεῖν τὸ καλόν, ὅτι ἐμοὶ τὸ κακὸν παράκειται. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.21",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.21"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Συνήδομαι γὰρ τῷ νόμῳ τοῦ Θεοῦ κατὰ τὸν ἔσω ἄνθρωπον· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.22",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.22"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "βλέπω δὲ ἕτερον νόμον ἐν τοῖς μέλεσί μου ἀντιστρατευόμενον τῷ νόμῳ τοῦ νοός μου, καὶ αἰχμαλωτίζοντά με ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.23",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.23"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἐν τῷ νόμῳ τῆς ἁμαρτίας τῷ ὄντι ἐν τοῖς μέλεσί μου. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.23",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.23"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ταλαίπωρος ἐγὼ ἄνθρωπος· τίς με ῥύσεται ἐκ τοῦ σώματος τοῦ θανάτου τούτου; ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.24",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.24"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Εὐχαριστῶ τῷ Θεῷ διὰ Ἰησοῦ Χριστοῦ τοῦ Κυρίου ἡμῶν. Ἄρα οὖν αὐτὸς ἐγὼ τῷ μὲν νοῒ δουλεύω νόμῳ Θεοῦ, τῇ δὲ σαρκὶ νόμῳ ἁμαρτίας.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.7.25",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.7.25"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Life in the Spirit",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Οὐδὲν ἄρα νῦν κατάκριμα τοῖς ἐν Χριστῷ Ἰησοῦ, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "μὴ κατὰ σάρκα περιπατοῦσιν, ἀλλὰ κατὰ πνεῦμα. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ὁ γὰρ νόμος τοῦ πνεύματος τῆς ζωῆς ἐν Χριστῷ Ἰησοῦ ἠλευθέρωσέ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "με ἀπὸ τοῦ νόμου τῆς ἁμαρτίας καὶ τοῦ θανάτου. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Τὸ γὰρ ἀδύνατον τοῦ νόμου, ἐν ᾧ ἠσθένει διὰ τῆς σαρκός, ὁ Θεὸς τὸν ἑαυτοῦ υἱὸν πέμψας ἐν ὁμοιώματι σαρκὸς ἁμαρτίας καὶ περὶ ἁμαρτίας κατέκρινε τὴν ἁμαρτίαν ἐν τῇ σαρκί· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἵνα τὸ δικαίωμα τοῦ νόμου πληρωθῇ ἐν ἡμῖν, τοῖς μὴ κατὰ σάρκα περιπατοῦσιν, ἀλλὰ κατὰ πνεῦμα. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Οἱ γὰρ κατὰ σάρκα ὄντες τὰ τῆς σαρκὸς φρονοῦσιν· οἱ δὲ κατὰ πνεῦμα τὰ τοῦ πνεύματος. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.5"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Τὸ γὰρ φρόνημα τῆς σαρκὸς θάνατος· τὸ δὲ φρόνημα τοῦ πνεύματος ζωὴ καὶ εἰρήνη· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "διότι τὸ φρόνημα τῆς σαρκὸς ἔχθρα εἰς Θεόν, τῷ γὰρ νόμῳ τοῦ Θεοῦ οὐχ ὑποτάσσεται, οὐδὲ γὰρ δύναται· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.7"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verseCount": 22,
    "copyright": "Public Domain",
    "parallels": [
      {
        "id": "ROM.7.11-ROM.8.7",
        "orgId": "ROM.7.11-ROM.8.7",
        "bibleId": "de4e12af7f28f599-01",
        "bookId": "ROM",
        "chapterIds": [
          "ROM.7",
          "ROM.8"
        ],
        "reference": "Romans 7:11-8:7",
        "content": [
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "For sin, taking occasion by the commandment, deceived me, and by it slew ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.11",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.11"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "me",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.7.11",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.7.11"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": ". ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.11",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.11"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Wherefore the law ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.12",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.12"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.7.12",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.7.12"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " holy, and the commandment holy, and just, and good. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.12",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.12"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Was then that which is good made death unto me? God forbid. But sin, that it might appear sin, working death in me by that which is good; that sin by the commandment might become exceeding sinful. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.13",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.13"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For we know that the law is spiritual: but I am carnal, sold under sin. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.14",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.14"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For that which I do I allow not: for what I would, that do I not; but what I hate, that do I. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.15",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.15"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "If then I do that which I would not, I consent unto the law that ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.16",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.16"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "it is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.7.16",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.7.16"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " good. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.16",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.16"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Now then it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.17",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.17"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For I know that in me (that is, in my flesh,) dwelleth no good thing: for to will is present with me; but ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.18",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.18"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "how",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.7.18",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.7.18"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " to perform that which is good I find not. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.18",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.18"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For the good that I would I do not: but the evil which I would not, that I do. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.19",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.19"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Now if I do that I would not, it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.20",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.20"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "I find then a law, that, when I would do good, evil is present with me. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.21",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.21"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For I delight in the law of God after the inward man: ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.22",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.22"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "But I see another law in my members, warring against the law of my mind, and bringing me into captivity to the law of sin which is in my members. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.23",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.23"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "O wretched man that I am! who shall deliver me from the body of this death? ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.24",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.24"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "I thank God through Jesus Christ our Lord. So then with the mind I myself serve the law of God; but with the flesh the law of sin.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.7.25",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.7.25"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "There is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.8.1",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.8.1"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " therefore now no condemnation to them which are in Christ Jesus, who walk not after the flesh, but after the Spirit. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.1",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.1"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For the law of the Spirit of life in Christ Jesus hath made me free from the law of sin and death. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.2",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.2"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For what the law could not do, in that it was weak through the flesh, God sending his own Son in the likeness of sinful flesh, and for sin, condemned sin in the flesh: ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.3",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.3"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "That the righteousness of the law might be fulfilled in us, who walk not after the flesh, but after the Spirit. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.4"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For they that are after the flesh do mind the things of the flesh; but they that are after the Spirit the things of the Spirit. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.5",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.5"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For to be carnally minded ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.6",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.6"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.8.6",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.8.6"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
